# The spirit still — and the wall at 96 percent
#
# Wine is a few percent ethanol. One pass through a still enriches it,
# a second pass more — and then the climb stops. Near 89 mol percent
# the vapour has the same composition as the liquid, and boiling harder
# enriches nothing. That wall is the azeotrope, and here it is computed
# from activity coefficients, not looked up.
register lv2
new
new
new
add v1 water 9.4mol
add v1 ethanol 0.6mol
inspect v1
distil v1 v2 0.1
inspect v2
distil v2 v3 0.3
inspect v3
distil v3 v4 0.3
inspect v4
